\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On June 9, 2026, Acucraft, a leading manufacturer of custom fireplaces and fire features, announced the launch of the Blaze Open Collection, a new line of luxury open-view gas fireplaces engineered to deliver an immersive fire experience without compromise. The collection is tailored for ambitious residential, hospitality, and commercial projects, combining unobstructed flames, exceptional flame presentation, whisper-quiet operation, and extensive customization options. Chris Maxson, Owner and CEO of Acucraft, stated, "Fire has always been about creating atmosphere and bringing people together," underscoring the company's commitment to delivering both beauty and performance in luxury environments. Featuring flames that average between 8 to 12 inches in height and capable of delivering up to 22,000 BTUs per linear foot, the Blaze Open fireplaces are available in eight standard viewing configurations, including single-sided, see-through, peninsula, panoramic, four-sided, corner, and indoor-outdoor designs. Acucraft's proprietary QuietFlow }
